cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper given under
  preferred-citation. This package builds on SpinGNN; please also cite the
  SpinGNN papers listed in https://github.com/Hyyu-Lab/SpinGNN.
title: SpinGNN-LAMMPS
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
repository-code: https://github.com/Hyyu-Lab/spingnn-lammps
url: https://github.com/Hyyu-Lab/spingnn-lammps
license:
  - GPL-2.0-only
  - AGPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  LAMMPS package for finite-temperature spin-lattice dynamics with
  machine-learned and analytic magnetic potentials. It provides the
  cached-field integrator (CFI, fix spin/lpsib), which needs one core model
  evaluation per step, and offline tools for the geometric-probe spin
  temperature (GPST), which uses first-order spin forces only.
authors:
  - given-names: Yuanmai
    family-names: Zheng
    affiliation: Fudan University
keywords:
  - spin-lattice dynamics
  - magnetic materials
  - machine-learning interatomic potentials
  - spin temperature
  - LAMMPS
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: Efficient spin-lattice dynamics and spin thermometry with machine-learned magnetic potentials
  authors:
